      "writtenOn": "2023-08-30T22:15:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Remove this switch statement, and just turn this into a state machine based on charge, as described in https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/188457962#comment13\n\nTo make things more clear, rewording here:\nFor maintaining  X \u003c charge \u003c Y:\nX \u003c soc \u003c Y:\n-if discharging, continue to discharge\n-if charging continue to charge\nsoc \u003c X:\n-charge normally\nY \u003c soc:\n-force discharge the battery\n\nFor maintaining a target charge X:\nsoc \u003c X:\n-charge normally\nsoc \u003d X:\n-charge idle\nsoc \u003e X:\n-force discharge the battery\n\nOnly check the current mode when handling the \"X \u003c soc \u003c Y\" case.",
      "revId": "2fd0899956c1527ef9a5b5e13267f241d13e0528",
